#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "168_Akiyama"
msgid "Now then, what seems to be the problem?"
msgstr "Pues ya estamos aquí. Cuénteme su historia."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "180_Nishihama"
msgid "My name's Nishihama, and I run a consulting business."
msgstr "Me llamo Nishihama y soy dueño de un negocio de consultoría."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "192_Nishihama"
msgid "It's my daughter... She's been kidnapped."
msgstr "El dinero me urge tanto porque... mi hija fue secuestrada."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "204_Akiyama"
msgid "Kidnapped? Have you contacted the police?"
msgstr "¿Secuestraron a su hija? ¿Ya habló con la policía?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "216_Nishihama"
msgid "How could I!? The kidnapper told me bad things would happen\\r\nto her if I called the cops. I'm here because I need money\\r\nto pay them off."
msgstr "¡No, no puedo! El secuestrador me dijo que la lastimaría\nsi se me ocurría llamar a la policía. Necesito pagar por\nsu rescate."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "228_Akiyama"
msgid "They're demanding a ransom?"
msgstr "¿Le están pidiendo dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "240_Nishihama"
msgid "Well, yes."
msgstr "Básicamente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "252_Hana"
msgid "Most kidnappings fail, you know. The police often wind up\\r\ncatching the criminals in the end, so you might want to try\\r\nthem first..."
msgstr "¿Sabe? La mayoría de secuestros casi nunca salen bien.\nLa policía siempre termina encontrando a los culpables.\nNo es mala idea hacer la denuncia..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "264_Nishihama"
msgid "Just because the police catch <Italic>most</Italic> of them doesn't mean my\\r\ndaughter won't get hurt! I'm not going to gamble with her\\r\nsafety like that!"
msgstr "¡Solo porque la policía atrape a la <Italic>mayoría</Italic> de ellos no quiere decir que mi hija no salga herida! ¡Esto no se trata de probabilidades!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "276_Nishihama"
msgid "Besides, even if they did catch this guy, my daughter is...\\r\ndelicate. If anything were to happen to her before they\\r\ncaught him..."
msgstr "Aun si consiguen atraparlos, mi hija es... sensible. Si algo\nle llega a pasar antes de que los atrapen..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "288_Hana"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "300_Akiyama"
msgid "I understand. But we can't be sure that money will\\r\nbring her home safe."
msgstr "Comprendo la situación. Pero, incluso si consigue el dinero, no está garantizado que recupere a su hija sana y salva."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "312_Nishihama"
msgid "Well, there's no sense in just talking about it! Here, take\\r\na look at this!"
msgstr "¡No puedo esperar más! ¡Solo mire esto!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "372_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm, interesting. Still, can't you just trace the email to find\\r\nout who the kidnapper is?"
msgstr "Ya veo... ¿Aún no ha intentado rastrear el correo para dar con el secuestrador?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "384_Nishihama"
msgid "They used my daughter's cell phone. I wrote back, but I guess\\r\nthey'd turned it off."
msgstr "Usaron el celular de mi hija. Contesté, pero no me respondieron."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "396_Akiyama"
msgid "Would you mind sending a copy of that photo to my phone, just in case?"
msgstr "Por si las dudas, ¿le importaría reenviarme esa foto?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "408_Nishihama"
msgid "Oh... Yeah, sure."
msgstr "Sí, claro."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "468_Akiyama"
msgid "Thanks. Sorry, but my business has turned me into a bit of a skeptic."
msgstr "Gracias. Perdón, pero soy algo desconfiado por culpa de mi trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "480_Akiyama"
msgid "So... How much were you looking to borrow?"
msgstr "Y dígame..., ¿cuánto es lo que le están pidiendo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "492_Nishihama"
msgid "The kidnapper is asking for a hundred million yen. I scraped\\r\nup seventy million by cleaning out my account and borrowing\\r\nthe rest from the bank..."
msgstr "Cien millones de yenes. Y por el momento he logrado conseguir setenta gracias a préstamos y lo que tenía de ahorros..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "504_Akiyama"
msgid "And now you need the remaining thirty million."
msgstr "Pero le faltan treinta millones."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "516_Nishihama"
msgid "That's correct... I heard you could make it happen without\\r\nany interest or collateral."
msgstr "Sí... Pero un día escuché de este lugar, donde se supone que\nhacen préstamos sin garantías ni intereses."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "528_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, I do have a few conditions. If you can pass my test,\\r\nthe loan is yours. No interest, no collateral."
msgstr "Bueno, mentira no es. Sin embargo, primero deberé someterlo\na una prueba para ver si es merecedor de ese dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "540_Nishihama"
msgid "I... Thank you so much! I'll do anything you ask! Anything!\\r\nPlease help me!"
msgstr "¡Se... se lo agradezco de todo corazón! ¡Haré cualquier cosa\nque usted me pida! ¡Tan solo ayúdeme a recuperar a mi hija!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "552_Akiyama"
msgid "...Honestly, I don't think I can trust you. Better you just\\r\nforget about the whole thing."
msgstr "Pensándolo bien..., usted no me convence. Mejor olvídelo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "564_Nishihama"
msgid "No! You can't mean that! You're the only person I can turn to!"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¡No puede estar hablando en serio, Akiyama-san! ¡Se lo\nsuplico, usted es mi única esperanza!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "576_Nishihama"
msgid "I've put all my assets up as collateral. You're the only one\\r\nwho'll even consider loaning me the last thirty million!"
msgstr "Ya busqué por todos lados..., ¡y usted es el único que está\ndispuesto a prestarme treinta millones!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "588_Nishihama"
msgid "I'm begging you, please reconsider! I won't leave until you\\r\nloan me the money!"
msgstr "¡Por favor, le ruego que lo piense de nuevo!\n¡No me retiraré hasta que lo reconsidere!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "600_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm... Let me think..."
msgstr "Ya, bueno... Es que si se pone así..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "612_Akiyama"
msgid "...No, I don't think I can trust you. Best just forget about\\r\nthe whole thing."
msgstr "Pensándolo bien..., usted no me convence. Mejor olvídelo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "624_Nishihama"
msgid "I'm begging you, please reconsider! I won't leave until you\\r\nloan me the money!"
msgstr "¡Por favor, le ruego que lo piense de nuevo!\n¡No me retiraré hasta que lo reconsidere!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "636_Akiyama"
msgid "...All right, but you'll have to pass my test first."
msgstr "Bueno... Pero recuerde que primero deberá pasar mi prueba."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "648_Akiyama"
msgid "We don't have much time, so let's get to it."
msgstr "Y dado que no tenemos mucho tiempo..., empecemos de una vez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "744_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan. Would you run a check for me on that Nishihama\\r\nguy? Oh, and look into how his business is holding up, as well."
msgstr "Hana-chan, ¿me harías el favor de investigar a nuestro nuevo amigo?\nAh, y también revisa qué tal va su empresa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "756_Hana"
msgid "Sure thing, Chief. Hang on."
msgstr "Claro, jefe. Deme un momento."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "768_Hana"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr "Veamos..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "780_Hana"
msgid "Here we go. Says here he lives with his wife and one daughter.\\r\nThe daughter's in high school..."
msgstr "Mmm..., aquí dice que vive con su esposa y su única hija,\nla cual aún va en la preparatoria..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "804_Akiyama"
msgid "High school, huh? That sounds about right."
msgstr "En preparatoria... Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "816_Hana"
msgid "Nishihama-san has no criminal record... Oh, but his daughter's\\r\nbeen taken in a few times."
msgstr "El señor Nishihama no tiene antecedentes penales... Ah, pero parece que su hija ha sido detenida más de una vez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "828_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm... Maybe she runs with a dangerous crowd. Anything else?"
msgstr "Mmm... Puede que se haya metido con gente peligrosa. ¿No hay nada más?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "840_Hana"
msgid "Nishihama runs a consulting business, and it appears to be\\r\ndoing all right... He has an average amount of debt."
msgstr "El señor Nishihama es dueño de una consultoría, y parece que\nno le va nada mal... Tampoco tiene muchas deudas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "864_Akiyama"
msgid "Interesting... A kidnapping strikes a completely ordinary\\r\nfamily..."
msgstr "Mmm, pero claro, ¿quién le demandaría cien millones a una familia\n\"común y corriente\"?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "948_Nishihama"
msgid "I got the contract. This should do the trick, right?"
msgstr "Uf... Uf... Logré que me contrataran. ¿Pasé la prueba?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "960_Akiyama"
msgid "That looks fine. Thanks. Looks like you passed the test."
msgstr "Sí, eso era todo. Gracias. Felicidades por superarla."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "972_Nishihama"
msgid "...No interest, no collateral?"
msgstr "Sin intereses, ni garantías..., ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "984_Akiyama"
msgid "Deal's a deal. I'll lend you thirty million, as promised.\\r\nHowever, I can't give you such a large sum right this\\r\nsecond."
msgstr "Así es. Le prestaré los treinta millones como prometí.\nAunque me temo que no podré dárselo todo de una vez."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "996_Nishihama"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "¿Mm?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1008_Akiyama"
msgid "It's not like I have it lying around. I'll send it over to\\r\nthe exchange point. It's safer that way."
msgstr "Eso no quiere decir que no los tenga, sino que se los daré\nmediante una transferencia; es la forma más segura de hacerlo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1020_Nishihama"
msgid "I suppose you're right..."
msgstr "Si usted lo dice..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1032_Akiyama"
msgid "Then, we're all set for today. I'll be waiting for your\\r\ncall."
msgstr "Muy bien, terminamos por hoy. Avíseme si necesita\nde algo más."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1044_Nishihama"
msgid "All right... I guess I'll head home, then. Just... please,\\r\nplease don't let me down on that thirty million yen!"
msgstr "Está bien... Supongo que, entonces, me iré a mi casa.\nSolo espero que... de verdad pueda darme ese dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1104_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan, could you get the money ready? I have a feeling\\r\nhe'll be calling sooner rather than later."
msgstr "Hana-chan, ve preparando ese dinero. Presiento que nos\nllamará en cualquier momento."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1116_Hana"
msgid "Yeah, okay... But are you really going to lend it to him?\\r\nHe's one shady customer..."
msgstr "Ahora mismo, jefe. Pero ¿de verdad le prestará todo ese dinero?\nEse Nishihama no me genera mucha confianza..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1128_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, he passed the test, so now I've got to uphold my end\\r\nof the deal. You wouldn't want a liar for a boss, would you?"
msgstr "Pasó la prueba, así que ahora debo cumplir con mi parte\ndel trato. No te gustaría tener a un mentiroso como jefe,\n¿o sí, Hana-chan?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1140_Hana"
msgid "I guess not..."
msgstr "No, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1152_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm going to step out for a moment. Take care of\\r\nthat money, okay?"
msgstr "Voy a salir un momento. Encárgate del dinero, ¿sí?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1164_Hana"
msgid "Sure thing. Be careful out there."
msgstr "Sí, está bien. Tenga cuidado allá afuera."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1212_Akiyama"
msgid "Give Him a Test"
msgstr "Ponerlo a prueba"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "1224_Akiyama"
msgid "Turn Him Down"
msgstr "Rechazarlo"

